    "title": "Thomas Peter Vander Sanden, Devoted Engineer and Family Man, Passes Away at 88",
    "text": "Thomas Peter Vander Sanden | Vandenberg Funeral Home - Tinley Park\nThomas Peter Vander Sanden | Vandenberg Funeral Home - Tinley Park\nTom was preceded in death by his beloved wife of fifty-nine years, Carol, and several siblings and in-laws. He is survived by his loving children: Scott, Ellen, Cheryl, Jean, Karen, and Steven, along with grandchildren and great-grandchildren. His siblings Mary Ann Behling and Carl Vander Sanden, as well as several siblings-in-law, also cherish his memory.\nA Funeral Mass will be held on August 4, 2025, at St. George Church in Tinley Park, with interment at Good Shepherd Cemetery in Orland Park. Visitation will take place on August 3, 2025, at Vandenberg Funeral Home. In lieu of flowers, donations to St. George Catholic Church, the American Cancer Society, or a charity of choice are encouraged.\nThomas Peter Vander Sanden will be remembered for his dedication to his family, community, and faith. To express condolences or order a memorial tree or flowers in his memory, please visit the flower store.\nClick here to read the original obituary.",
